  "description": "Shared scaffolding for the chrischall MCP fleet \u2014 server bootstrap, tool-result formatting, helpful errors, hardened env/config, a bearer API-client kit, zod atoms, session registries, a fetchproxy transport adapter, auth resolver skeletons, an in-memory ",
